[{"id":2604053311,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6bNrM_","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected.\r\n\r\nHowever, I think the default warning mark is too prominent by default and draws attention away from errors.\r\n\r\nDefault | Black (OLED) | Light\r\n-|-|-\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cf73dc20-906d-4722-9b2c-9305419f4dd0) | ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/79782ae8-8fe8-49e6-a29c-541115370654) | ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4dfd9c1d-5e76-47ac-9df0-bf76093449db)\r\n\r\nWith opacity reduced by half on the warning mark color:\r\n\r\nDefault | Black (OLED) | Light\r\n-|-|-\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4f095857-fc26-4f41-8af1-7a206641a425) | ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e9795068-ccd2-4396-91b6-551af165c49a) | ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e218d5c4-0b1c-4da5-af49-88267ce1bae8)\r\n\r\nWe should remember that many projects out there have dozens of warnings (if not hundreds) that were never noticed by users (and therefore not fixed), so we should ensure we don't highlight warnings too prominentl by default.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102469#pullrequestreview-2604053311","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102469","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-02-08T21:37:20Z"},{"id":2604053407,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6bNrOf","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_